# Quran Tutor — UI design patterns

Reuse these patterns for Epics 5–7+ UI. Do not invent a new visual language.

## Brand & tokens (`app/globals.css`)

- Forest green primary `#0d4a3a` + warm gold accent `#c9a227` (not purple, not cream-serif terracotta clichés).
- Fonts: Plus Jakarta (UI) + Fraunces (display via `.display-title`).
- Prefer CSS vars: `--color-primary`, `--color-accent`, `--color-surface-elevated`, radii, shadows.
- Utilities: `.panel-canvas`, `.panel-sidebar`, `.surface-card`, `.surface-card-interactive`, `.btn-panel` / `.btn-panel-primary|secondary`, `.status-pill-*`, `.eyebrow`, `.nav-glass`.

## App shells (parent / tutor / admin)

- Desktop: dark green sidebar (`.panel-sidebar`) + content column with sticky glass header.
- Mobile: sticky top bar + horizontal scroll nav pills (`PanelNavLink`), not a random new nav.
- Shared pieces: `UserAvatar`, notification **bell** (not inline dashboard lists), `PanelPageHeader`, `SignOutButton` in sidebar footer.
- Home pages: eyebrow + title + short status + **stat strip** + **action cards** (`surface-card-interactive`).
- Parent IA: Home → Browse → Learners → Bookings → Schedule → Messages → Account (no separate More tab; shortcuts live on Account).
- Empty states: eyebrow + display title + one sentence + primary CTA (`btn-panel-primary`).
- Checkout / success: `PanelPageHeader` + `TrustStrip` + `surface-card` package summary.

## Marketing & public listing

- Marketing: search hero, trust strip, card grids; auth-aware nav (dashboard CTA when signed in).
- Tutor profile: Superprof-style — photo-first, free-trial badge, subject chips, sticky **Book free trial** (mobile bar + desktop card). Never “Contact”/pay-tutor-directly CTAs.
- Currency/copy: **USD**; platform payments trust messaging.

## Media & account

- Profile photos: Cloudinary via `uploadProfilePhoto` → `profiles.photo_url`; tutors sync to listing.
- Listing photo optional; fall back to profile photo on browse/detail.
- Account photo UI: `/parent/account`, `/tutor/account`, `/admin/account` + `ProfilePhotoForm`.

## Do / don’t

- Do: rounded-full primary CTAs, soft cards, status pills, skeletons for loading lists.
- Don’t: purple gradients, Inter/Roboto defaults, hero card clutter, notifications dumped on home, new shell layouts per feature.
